{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Y47zTDNZ5X1795531851.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞冠精英盃，柏雷素爾作客以2-1，擊敗紐卡素噴射機。 </p><p></p><p>深色衫的柏雷素爾，由山內日向汰，開賽7分鐘補射入網，為客隊領先一球。 </p><p></p><p>他們前四輪2勝1和1負，噴射機則全敗，雖然哥洛夫勁射破網，24分鐘追成1-1，但這支澳職球隊，最終1分不保，日職的柏雷素爾靠弓場堅真，70分鐘射入近柱，以2-1勝出，五戰後有10分，噴射機連輸五輪，在東亞區0分包尾。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:44:26.125232+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T00:57:14.323343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T16:37:40.565532+00:00","content_hash":"6fe27e858353acb3d8623b46a6fc2f5112a4b758b79a1613c9c9bd305c016db5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:44:26.125232+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}